  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "I like the beauty of Apple's Swift language more than Google's Go.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ok, it is subjective.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Apple has Swift open source, I decided to run a simple benchmark test to have an objective idea for which language is better in terms of speed.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bubble sort in Go,",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bubble sort in Swift,",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You can hardly tell which language is better from the above samples.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "However, the results is pretty easy to guess,↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Swift completed in 5.85 seconds but Go only needs 0.74 seconds.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ok, I am curious to know the performance of other languages.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Test runs 3 times for each language, and discard time from the first run.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The result is average from the second and last run.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It is enough as this test is just for fun.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "_Warning: No optimization flag uses for all compilers/interpreters.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "You will experience huge differences once you apply those flag.",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test",
        "title": ">-",
        "url": "/blog/go-vs-swift-a-simple-benchmark-test/"
      }
    },
    {
